SUMMARY:Splat Space Member meeting
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nOn the first Tuesday of ev
 ery month\, we hold our Member Meeting. This meeting is an opportunity for
  the Splat Space board to update the members on events\, issues and news r
 elated to Splat Space.\n\nWhile the majority of our members attend in pers
 on and we encourage them to do so\, we stream the meeting using Google Mee
 t for those who want to attend remotely.\n\nClick this link attend the mee
 ting online.\n\n[https://meet.google.com/usc-eavv-jkc](https://meet.google
 .com/usc-eavv-jkc)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/315305534/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260617T231913Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260617T231913Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_315319974@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260703T040117Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260708T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260708T200000
SUMMARY:Woodshop Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nWhat is Wood-shop Wednesda
 y? Well its basically an open house for the Splat Space Wood-shop.\n\nHave
  a project you need help with? Want to learn how to safely use the wood sh
 op equipment? Just want to hang out and talk shop? Come on by. Each week o
 ne or more of our more knowledgeable wood workers will be there to help. N
 o need to sign up.\n\nNot a Splat Space member?\nWell you are also welcome
  to join us\, but unfortunately because of insurance limitation\, you cann
 ot use the equipment.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you all there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/315319974/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260618T215136Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260618T215136Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_315356251@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260703T040117Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T130000
SUMMARY:Monthly Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nThe Saturday after the mon
 thly members meeting of each month is our Cleanup Day. It's a chance for o
 ur members to come together to help make Splat Space more organized. Wheth
 er it's sorting bolts\, vacuuming the carpets\, removing scrap or re-arran
 ging the space\, anything that helps to make the space more open and organ
 ized is appreciated.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/315356251/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T162626Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T162626Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_315357223@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260703T040117Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T160000
SUMMARY:Open House
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nEvery Saturday between 1pm
  to 4pm we open our doors to the public to give anyone who wants to stop b
 y a chance to see our space. It's a chance for prospective new members to 
 take a tour of our space and ask any questions they have about what we off
 er.\n\nFeel free to come by or contact us if you want to schedule a tour.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/315357223/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T173930Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T173930Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
